Claude CodeAny client with a JSON config <pre><code>claude mcp add --transport http fsmes http://127.0.0.1:8310/mcp
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "fsmes": { "type": "streamable-http", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8310/mcp" }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Then: "list the plants, then show me the open orders on the first one" — <code>list_plants</code> is where the server's own instructions tell an agent to start.</p>
